@title The quiet toast and the refusal mark in the Light look
@area Schematic
# Light-look check of the polish PRs: the refusal cross and reason beside a refused wire start, and a message toast. Pictures are the evidence.
click_text "Open example"
wait 20
key ctrl+k
wait 6
text preferences
wait 8
key Enter
wait 10
click_text Light
wait 10
key Escape
wait 6
click_text Connect
wait 6
click 700 400
wait 6
shot refusal-mark-light
key Escape
wait 4
key ctrl+k
wait 4
text export pdf
wait 6
key Enter
wait 30
shot toast-light
check_layout
